==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|LL.}} {{term|persecutio|persecūtio|chase, pursuit|lang=la}}, from {{etyl|la}} {{term|persequor||follow up, pursue|lang=la}}, from {{prefix|per|sequor|t1=through|t2=follow|lang=la}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en-us-persecution.ogg|Audio (US)}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-}}

# The act of [[persecute|persecuting]].
# A [[program]] or [[campaign]] to [[subjugate]] or [[eliminate]] a [[specific]] group of [[people]], often based on [[race]], [[religion]], [[sexuality]], or [[social]] [[beliefs]].

